    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1478">

                <pb facs="1118" n="1002" xml:id="pg1002"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.115/215.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Bonney to the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">San Luis Potosí</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-06-28">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 28, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your June 25 was effective. Offending officer has been recalled to Monterey.
                    District quiet. Military and repair train has gone north to open railway to
                    Saltillo.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bonney</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
